    "norm": "Tests unknown key replace. <p>Verifies two behaviours: <ol> <li>An unknown key with no default value (e.g. {@code ${person}}) is left untouched in the output.</li> <li>An unknown key that carries a default value via the {@code :-} delimiter (e.g. {@code ${undefined.number:-1234567890}}) is replaced with that default value.</li> </ol> In both cases a known key ({@code ${target}}) is still resolved normally."
